## Security Considerations

### Token Security
- Store access tokens securely and implement rotation
- Use short-lived tokens where possible
- Implement proper token validation in applications

### Permission Management
- Regularly audit agent permissions
- Implement just-in-time access where appropriate
- Monitor agent activity through audit logs

### Blueprint Governance
- Establish naming conventions for blueprints and agents
- Implement approval workflows for blueprint creation
- Document blueprint purposes and ownership

